## Performance Considerations

### Efficient Data Structures
```cpp
// Use QList for waypoint storage (efficient for sequential access)
QList<QGeoCoordinate> waypoints;

// Reserve space to avoid reallocations
waypoints.reserve(expectedCount);

// Use const references to avoid copying
void processWaypoints(const QList<QGeoCoordinate>& waypoints);
```

### Asynchronous Operations
```cpp
// Use QTimer for delayed operations
QTimer::singleShot(100, this, [this]() {
    // Perform mission generation after UI updates
    generateWaypointsFromPosition(vehiclePosition, areaSize, altitude, frontDistance);
});
```